It builds on, and depends on, the open-source Kaia.ai / Maker's Pet robotics
platform. None of the upstream packages are modified or vendored here; they are
used as ROS 2 dependencies at the versions pinned in upstream.repos.

  Kaia.ai platform        https://github.com/kaiaai        (Apache-2.0)
  Maker's Pet robots      https://github.com/makerspet     (Apache-2.0)
  BLD-120MM build guide   https://makerspet.com/blog/bld-120mm-pack/

Files in this repository that are adapted from upstream sources are listed
below together with their origin. Each such file also carries a header comment
naming its source.

  bld120_sim/config/gz_bridge.yaml
      adapted from makerspet_mini/config/gz_bridge.yaml (Maker's Pet, Apache-2.0):
      ground-truth odometry bridged to /ground_truth/odom, its transform dropped.
  bld120_sim/bld120_sim/odometry_model.py (FirmwareOdometry)
      re-implements in Python the odometry integration of calcOdometry() in
      kaiaai/firmware v0.8.4, kaiaai-esp32.ino (Kaia.ai, Apache-2.0).
